sequenceDiagram
    participant Dependency as DependencyScanner
    participant ProjectScanner
    participant Env as EnvScanner
    participant Runner as run_command
    participant Python as Python / pip / docker commands

    ProjectScanner->>Dependency: scan dependency and build files
    Dependency-->>ProjectScanner: requirements metadata
    ProjectScanner->>Env: scan(requirements)
    Env->>Env: build required tool list
    loop each required tool
        Env->>Runner: run candidate command
        Runner->>Python: execute command with timeout
        Python-->>Runner: stdout/stderr/exit code
        Runner-->>Env: CommandResult
    end
    Env->>Env: check Python version requirement
    Env->>Env: check declared runtime/dev packages
    Env-->>ProjectScanner: CheckResult(Environment)
